[0m→ [0mRead src/main.rs[90m [offset=470, limit=165][0m
The regression is localized to the new Escape-stop implementation: cancellation is checked before queued mouse input is drained, so a quick input-then-Escape sequence can serialize `[]`. I’m going to move cancellation to the end of each polling pass and add a focused, hardware-independent regression test around the polling decision.
