The listener now keeps per-device absolute coordinates, emits relative deltas for touchpad movement, and resets the baseline between touch gestures to avoid a jump at the start of the next gesture. I’ve also broadened device selection from “left plus right/middle buttons” to actual pointer-axis capability, which covers one-button touchpads without admitting keyboards.
