Fixed the empty mouse recording output in `src/linux.rs`.

- Detects one-button touchpads and absolute pointer devices.
- Converts absolute X/Y changes into relative `MouseEvent::Move` events.
- Resets position tracking between touch gestures to prevent jumps.
- Added regression tests for absolute movement and touch release.

Verification passed:

- `cargo test --all-targets --all-features` with 26 tests
- `cargo clippy --all-targets --all-features -- -D warnings`
- `cargo fmt --check`
- `git diff --check`

Physical input hardware was not available for an end-to-end recording smoke test.
